From cbe79c28cce6302affbbfe753d573afe4beea646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: native-host draft <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 01:34:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Forward webrtc::RTCErrorType through SDP and candidate
 completions

Error gains typed Rtc { operation, kind, message } and Timeout variants and
becomes non_exhaustive. The C++ glue already receives webrtc::RTCError and
now passes error.type() beside the message; glue-side refusals report a
reserved 1000 (NoPeerConnection). Callers that matched only Webrtc(String)
for SDP failures and timeouts must add the new arms.

Draft for review; not proposed upstream from this session.
